@startuml redis_role
title Redis 的两个职责
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "v2-dji-worker" as Worker
component "web\nDjango ASGI" as Web

rectangle "Redis" as Redis {
  component "1. Channels 广播\n组: v2.dji.mqtt" as Channels
  component "2. worker 心跳\nkey: v2:dji:mqtt:health:<connection_id>\nTTL: 30s 默认" as Heartbeat
}

component "WebSocket\n/ws/v2/dji/mqtt" as WS
component "MQTT 健康 API\n/mqtt-health" as HealthApi

Worker --> Channels : group_send(mqtt.message)
Channels --> WS : 推给已订阅前端
Web --> WS : 管理连接和权限过滤

Worker --> Heartbeat : setex(status, heartbeatAt)
HealthApi --> Heartbeat : 读取 redisState
Web --> HealthApi : 返回健康状态

note bottom of Redis
Redis 不存业务主数据。
业务真相在 PostgreSQL。
end note

@enduml
